  "prefLabel": "Plc 1802.06 Approved continuing education",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1802.06 “Approved continuing education” means:\n\n(a) A course or workshop with designated credit hours pertaining to appraisal of real estate for tax purposes that is offered or approved by a qualified entity; or\n\n(b) Teaching a course or workshop that would qualify as approved continuing education as specified in (a), above.\n\nSource. #14330, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1800.html"
